# {{project_name}}

A Kubernetes operator built with [kube-rs](https://kube.rs/).

## Prerequisites

- Rust 1.75 or later
- kubectl configured with cluster access
- Docker (for building container images)

## Building

```bash
cargo build --release
```

## Running Locally

```bash
# Run against your current kubectl context
cargo run
```

## Testing

```bash
cargo test
```

## Deployment

### Building the Docker Image

```bash
docker build -t {{project_name}}:latest .
```

### Deploying to Kubernetes

```bash
# Apply CRDs
kubectl apply -f manifests/crds/

# Deploy the operator
kubectl apply -f manifests/deployment.yaml
```

## Development

### Adding a New CRD

```bash
kubegen add crd MyCrd --group {{domain}}
```

### Project Structure

```
{{project_name}}/
├── Cargo.toml
├── src/
│   ├── main.rs      # Entry point
│   ├── lib.rs       # Library exports
│   └── error.rs     # Error types
└── manifests/       # Kubernetes manifests
```

